OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cold night
OL,6,Fto come, with cloudy skies. Rain,
OL,7,Fperhaps falling as snow over higher
OL,8,Fground for a time, and gusty winds
OL,9,Fmove eastwards through the region.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FWidespread rain through much
OL,12,Fof the day with some gusty winds at
OL,13,Ffirst. Rain, perhaps falling as snow
OL,14,Ffor a time over hills.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWet
OL,17,Fand windy on Saturday before clearing
OL,18,Fto the east by the evening. Winds
OL,19,Feasing into Sunday, where showers
OL,20,Ffollow and turning milder. Turning wet
OL,21,Fand windy again on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
